% Conformance: a problem outside the pattern fragment is suspended by LeanElpi (as the
% requirement says); ELPI 1.18 approximates it instead. Registered in divergences.md.
% Exercises: elpi-core-engine › Higher-order pattern unification.
kind t type.
type g t -> t.

main :- pi a\ (Y a a = g a, Y = (x\ y\ g y), print Y).
